{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqgol6tu84d","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"CLI init hardening: resolveInstallDir checks 3 levels up from packages/cli/bin","summary":"resolveInstallDir() uses path.resolve(__dirname, '..', '..', '..') — three levels up from packages/cli/bin — as the candidate repo root. It checks for daemon.js + mcp-graph.js + package.json at that path. When all three exist, INSTALL_DIR is set to the local checkout (no clone). This covers the case where zonoid is run from its own monorepo checkout AND the case where it is installed as an npm package (the three levels land outside the package and the check fails, so fallback to ~/.claude/orchestrator is used).","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-16T13:31:49.074Z","vec":[-0.13953271508216858,0.046524740755558014,0.04198272153735161,-0.05935698375105858,0.011210800148546696,-0.09643534570932388,-0.03465159982442856,0.05357595160603523,-0.02677939273416996,0.03577599674463272,0.0496206171810627,0.011100828647613525,0.051747217774391174,0.04189056158065796,0.030191827565431595,0.019390549510717392,0.09361386299133301,-0.06081394478678703,0.021547453477978706,-0.0030071991495788097,-0.008806894533336163,-0.02613777294754982,0.037726834416389465,-0.04783306643366814,-0.0210067480802536,-0.02667318470776081,-0.06476448476314545,0.013902967795729637,0.038072820752859116,0.06324758380651474,0.05076531320810318,0.16147293150424957,-0.023959429934620857,-0.061542775481939316,0.06520867347717285,0.13621656596660614,0.0476088672876358,-0.015183035284280777,-0.009909451939165592,-0.0028192871250212193,0.12003596127033234,0.10148652642965317,-0.02425723522901535,-0.0716022402048111,-0.005588252563029528,-0.045396510511636734,-0.04979133605957031,-0.02596461772918701,-0.0818561390042305,-0.034443292766809464,-0.020482981577515602,-0.018549755215644836,0.05383993312716484,-0.03971708193421364,0.009712567552924156,0.09370771050453186,-0.021849680691957474,0.0628824457526207,0.08161001652479172,0.032975472509